        "name": "Estelindis",
        "username": "Estelindis",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/estelindis/{size}/2017_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-17T21:17:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>Although Advanced Blade is pretty entertaining… </span> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=12\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Advanced Blade is actually the one I'm thinking of most. &nbsp;I find he makes a very fun introductory game for newbies.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
