        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-17T23:04:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not fussed about Advanced Mode either - we just want a good fun game without it being overly difficult (and some of the villains are hard enough as it is ;)), plus as Silverleaf says, it's just extra stuff to have to remember on top of whatever else is going on ;). We've done Advanced Gloomy at the London meets a few times, though ;).</p>",
