        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-18T01:32:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, Gloomy and Blade I usually do on advanced. I think Blade's front side advanced effect is really good.</p>",
