      {
        "id": 131716,
        "name": "Pulseglazer",
        "username": "Pulseglazer",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/f04885/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-18T01:47:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For my group, I keep track of basically everything (hp, passives, etc), so that means a no to advanced mode usually.  Weirdly advanced is better when I solo play, as I pretty clearly have most stuff planned, but that depends a lot on how many times I’ve fought the villain.  Advanced Mode is all I play on the app though. If the programming takes care of triggers, I’m all about it.</p>",
