      {
        "id": 131717,
        "name": "MrLeRobot",
        "username": "MrLeRobot",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mrlerobot/{size}/1932_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-18T03:26:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For some reason, I thought that most of the forums veterans were playing on advanced all the time. I felt cheap playing basic villains, but your comments put things in perspective...!</p><p>I personnally prefer basic villains too. It is more enjoyable for me and my friends too. And it's not like I haven't played enough to know the heroes, SotM is by a large margin my most played game. Nice to see I'm not alone...!</p>",
