        "created_at": "2015-02-18T05:22:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MrLeRobot\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mrlerobot/48/1932_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MrLeRobot:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>For some reason, I thought that most of the forums veterans were playing on advanced all the time. I felt cheap playing basic villains, but your comments put things in perspective…!I personnally prefer basic villains too. It is more enjoyable for me and my friends too. And it's not like I haven't played enough to know the heroes, SotM is by a large margin my most played game. Nice to see I'm not alone…!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I second all of this, except the part about friends</p>\n<p>and the most played game, I do a lot of gaming in general</p>",
