      {
        "id": 131719,
        "name": "Fabled_Alpaca",
        "username": "Fabled_Alpaca",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-18T11:12:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Estelindis\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/estelindis/48/2017_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Estelindis:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I made these pics, if it's any help. &nbsp;The hero one is a bit squished vertically, as I needed to fit everything into a certain image size. &nbsp;Sorry about that.You can have the document I used to make them too, if you like:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B08-FCDToRDxRjB6Smx1c1pPYjQ/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B08-FCDToRDxRjB6Smx1c1pPYjQ/view?usp=sh…</a> &nbsp;However, unless you have the proper fonts installed (CrashLanding and RedStateBlueState), it won't look the same. &nbsp;The fonts are here:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.blambot.com/font_crashlanding.shtml\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.blambot.com/font_crashlanding.shtml</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.blambot.com/font_rsbs.shtml\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.blambot.com/font_rsbs.shtml</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Perfect, that's pretty much what I wanted. Thank you,</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Our group has yet to venture onto the advanced mode with Villains, as most people have said, the extra book keeping puts us off.</p>",
